WEBVTT

00:00:00.008 --> 00:00:03.032
We’ll move through a practical cleaning sequence.

00:00:03.032 --> 00:00:05.197
First diagnose the data.

00:00:05.197 --> 00:00:14.422
Then count missing values, detect duplicates, correct data types, standardize categories, flag possible outliers,

00:00:14.422 --> 00:00:16.912
and create simple EDA summaries.

00:00:17.631 --> 00:00:23.889
The final example combines those steps into a small cleaning pipeline so you can see how they fit together.
